{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22086","headline":"新乐府 草茫茫\t惩厚葬也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 草茫茫\t惩厚葬也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草茫茫，土苍苍，苍苍茫茫在何处，骊山脚下秦皇墓。\n墓中下涸二重泉，当时自以爲深固。\n下流水银象江海，上缀珠光作乌兔。\n别爲天地於其间，拟将富贵随身去。\n一朝盗掘坟陵破，龙椁神堂三月火。\n可怜宝玉归人间，暂借泉中买身祸。\n奢者狼藉俭者安，一凶一吉在眼前。\n凭君回首向南望，汉文葬在霸陵原。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}